<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN OPEN SECOND DAY SCHEDULE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN OPEN SECOND DAY SCHEDULE.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schedule of play on the second day of the US$7.6 million Australian Open tennis tournament on Tuesday (prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Centre Court (2345 GMT start, Monday)</p>
<p>Petr Korda (Czech Republic) v 9-Marcelo Rios (Chile)</p>
<p>Barbara Rittner (Germany) v 4-Martina Hingis (Switzerland)</p>
<p>1-Pete Sampras (U.S.) v Dinu Pescariu (Romania)</p>
<p>Night session (0800 GMT start)</p>
<p>Gloria Pizzichini (Italy) v 2-Arantxa Sanchez Vicario (Spain)</p>
<p>10-Albert Costa (Spain) v Patrick Rafter (Australia)</p>
<p>Court One (2300 GMT start, Monday)</p>
<p>Amy Frazier (U.S.) v 5-Anke Huber (Germany)</p>
<p>Mark Woodforde (Australia) v Michael Tebbutt (Australia)</p>
<p>3-Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia) v Ben Ellwood (Australia)</p>
<p>15-Chanda Rubin (U.S.) v Radka Zrubakova (Slovakia)</p>
<p>Court Two (2300 GMT start, Monday)</p>
<p>Carlos Costa (Spain) v 8-Wayne Ferreira (South Africa)</p>
<p>Nathalie Dechy (France) v 7-Lindsay Davenport (U.S.)</p>
<p>Marc Rosset (Switzerland) v Javier Sanchez (Spain)</p>
<p>6-Iva Majoli (Croatia) v Patty Schnyder (Switzerland).</p>
</text>
